### Key Finding ###
Design A (D-in-pk) GAN-gate bypass rate is substantial and non-monotonic across
L1-L5 (34% -> 77% -> 75% -> 37% -> 100%, mean over 5 seeds), while Design B (hash
commitment, C_G + pi) holds at 0.0% +/- 0.0% across all five levels and all five
seeds. 'Full Forgery' is 0% for both designs at every level -- Gates 1-2 (lattice
hardness) independently block forgery regardless of the Gate-3 outcome, so the
'GAN gate' column (not 'Full Forgery') is the metric that isolates Gate 3's own
security margin, which is what the manuscript's central claim is about.
